OL,3,GNEWSAStation entrance plans on hold due
OL,4,Ato access concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever the project has been criticised
OL,7,Ffor being a "substantial departure"
OL,8,Ffrom the original plans and not having
OL,9,Fa dedicated drop-off area, which would
OL,10,Fespecially affect people with
OL,11,Fdisabilities.
OL,13,FThe Scarborough and Whitby Area
OL,14,FPlanning Committee unanimously agreed
OL,15,Fto defer the plans.
